# Test area: the escape room (story/shed.story), start to finish, plus the wrong order on the hinges.
# SPOILERS: this is the whole solution.

chapter shed
idle
expect @shed&!free
# --- the door won't open
spot Door
spot Handle
idle
spot Back
# --- the window: four numbers on the fence
spot Window
spot Sign on the fence
idle
expect sawSign
spot Back
# --- the workbench: the note, then the drawer (a wrong code first)
spot Workbench
spot Note on the wall
idle
expect ev_sh_note
spot Drawer
number 1234
idle
expect !drawerOpen
spot Drawer
number 4719
idle
expect drawerOpen&ev_sh_light&ev_sh_driver
spot Back
# --- the dark corner: flashlight to see, screwdriver for the board
spot Dark corner
spot Floorboards
choose Unscrew it
idle
expect ev_sh_key
spot Back
# --- the shelf: the key opens the toolbox
spot Shelf
spot Toolbox
choose Try the small key
idle
expect ev_sh_oil&ev_sh_hammer
spot Back
# --- the door: hammer first doesn't work, oil then hammer does
spot Door
spot Hinges
choose Hit the pins with the hammer
idle
expect !free
spot Hinges
choose Oil the hinges
idle
spot Hinges
choose Hit the pins with the hammer
idle
expect free
spot Go outside
idle
